    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SkateNationXL</strong> is an <i>indie arcade skateboarding</i> game that pays tribute to the <i>classics</i> of the genre. Set in a world <i>inspired by real-life  spots</i>, it invites players to  skate, and compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/a8f7f06bfbb3a2a4bb2e1ca3645b9d5e.avif?t=1744637317\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span><strong>Customize your experience</strong> by creating a <i>unique skater</i> and <i>board setup</i>. Choose your outfit, gear, and deck to stand out both offline and online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/9c630ae8440eba8dfd2d3fa62979f376.avif?t=1744637317\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join dedicated servers to skate with others in real time, or hop into player-hosted sessions to hang out  together.</strong> <strong>Lobby Mode</strong> offers a <i>relaxed space</i> to meet up with friends and cruise at your own pace, while <strong>Showdown</strong> brings the competition in a fast-paced mode for up to <i>8 players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/2bcd60e66b54d052db1aa9b318bae5b2.avif?t=1744637317\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SkateNationXL\u00a0</strong>It\u2019s a <i>modern tribute</i> to  <strong>classic arcade skateboarding</strong> <strong>games</strong>\u2014blending familiar vibes with today\u2019s tools and online play. Whether you're chasing high scores, unlocking new gear, or just cruising with friends, <i>SkateNationXL</i> gives you the freedom to skate your way. Drop in, express yourself, and leave your mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/d194c8e41158175539362593fa47c43e.avif?t=1744637317\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SkateNationXL</strong> is an <i>indie arcade skateboarding</i> game that pays tribute to the <i>classics</i> of the genre. Set in a world <i>inspired by real-life  spots</i>, it invites players to  skate, and compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/a8f7f06bfbb3a2a4bb2e1ca3645b9d5e.avif?t=1744637317\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span><strong>Customize your experience</strong> by creating a <i>unique skater</i> and <i>board setup</i>. Choose your outfit, gear, and deck to stand out both offline and online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/9c630ae8440eba8dfd2d3fa62979f376.avif?t=1744637317\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join dedicated servers to skate with others in real time, or hop into player-hosted sessions to hang out  together.</strong> <strong>Lobby Mode</strong> offers a <i>relaxed space</i> to meet up with friends and cruise at your own pace, while <strong>Showdown</strong> brings the competition in a fast-paced mode for up to <i>8 players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/2bcd60e66b54d052db1aa9b318bae5b2.avif?t=1744637317\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SkateNationXL\u00a0</strong>It\u2019s a <i>modern tribute</i> to  <strong>classic arcade skateboarding</strong> <strong>games</strong>\u2014blending familiar vibes with today\u2019s tools and online play. Whether you're chasing high scores, unlocking new gear, or just cruising with friends, <i>SkateNationXL</i> gives you the freedom to skate your way. Drop in, express yourself, and leave your mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629350/extras/d194c8e41158175539362593fa47c43e.avif?t=1744637317\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "SkateNationXL is an arcade skateboarding game that celebrates the spirit of the classics, set in locations inspired by real-life spots. Master challenges, pull off wild tricks, hang out with friends in Lobby Mode, or join Showdown\u2014an 8-player competitive mode.",
